&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;(4) 主要な取得関連費用の内容及び金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;アドバイザリーに対する報酬・手数料等　　35,000千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;(5) 発生したのれんの金額、発生原因、償却方法及び償却期間&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;①　発生したのれんの金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;309,154千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;②　発生原因&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;今後の事業展開によって期待される超過収益力であります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;③　償却方法及び償却期間&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;５年にわたる均等償却&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
